OL,3,ATexas ICE shooting leaves Venezuelan
OL,4,ADoorDash driver with bullet in his
OL,5,Aback, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Venezuelan DoorDash delivery driver
OL,8,Fwho was shot by ICE agents was
OL,9,Ftransferred from hospital to a
OL,10,Fdetention centre with a bullet still in
OL,11,Fhis back, his lawyer has told US media.
OL,13,FThe shooting of Wilber Rafael Garces
OL,14,FPerez, 28, triggered protests in
OL,15,FAustin, Texas, on Sunday.
OL,17,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,18,F(DHS) said in a statement to the BBC it
OL,19,Fwas investigating the shooting of a man
OL,20,Fin the Texan capital who had entered
OL,21,Fthe country illegally.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
