OL,3,ATexas ICE shooting leaves Venezuelan
OL,4,ADoorDash driver with bullet in his
OL,5,Aback, says lawyer
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was unclear what led to the shooting
OL,8,Fwith the local mayor and police
OL,9,Fdemanding an investigation. It comes
OL,10,Fmonths after a man in Houston was shot
OL,11,Fdead by an ICE officer.
